; reduce_index_out_of_range: REDUCE with var_b outside the model raises
; IndexOutOfBounds.
;
; spec/xqvm/ISA.md's REDUCE row: IndexOutOfBounds if var_a or var_b is out
; of range [0, model.size) before allocation. The default budget pays the
; charge, which spec/xqvm/SPEC.md places ahead of the range check, so the
; range check decides. reduce_charge_before_index_check pins the case where
; the budget cannot pay.

PUSH 4
BQMX r0
PUSH 0           ; var_a
PUSH 4           ; var_b, out of range [0, 4)
PUSH 1           ; P_aux
REDUCE r0
HALT
